nk:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-3D\" x=\"1028\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(2084,0)\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMATHI-42\" x=\"24\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(0,500)\">\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-AF\" x=\"-70\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(207.3338615074012,0) scale(0.9753329657129242,1)\">\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-AF\"></use>\n</g>\n <use transform=\"scale(0.707)\" xlink:href=\"#E3-MJMAIN-AF\" x=\"643\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</svg></span> is a <strong>necessary</strong> condition for <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"10.351ex\" height=\"2.509ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.505ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -863.1 4456.5 1080.4\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-4-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-4-Title\">A\\cap B = \\emptyset</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E4-MJMATHI-41\" d=\"M208 74Q208 50 254 46Q272 46 272 35Q272 34 270 22Q267 8 264 4T251 0Q249 0 239 0T205 1T141 2Q70 2 50 0H42Q35 7 35 11Q37 38 48 46H62Q132 49 164 96Q170 102 345 401T523 704Q530 716 547 716H555H572Q578 707 578 706L606 383Q634 60 636 57Q641 46 701 46Q726 46 726 36Q726 34 723 22Q720 7 718 4T704 0Q701 0 690 0T651 1T578 2Q484 2 455 0H443Q437 6 437 9T439 27Q443 40 445 43L449 46H469Q523 49 533 63L521 213H283L249 155Q208 86 208 74ZM516 260Q516 271 504 416T490 562L463 519Q447 492 400 412L310 260L413 259Q516 259 516 260Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E4-MJMAIN-2229\" d=\"M88 -21T75 -21T55 -7V200Q55 231 55 280Q56 414 60 428Q61 430 61 431Q77 500 152 549T332 598Q443 598 522 544T610 405Q611 399 611 194V-7Q604 -22 591 -22Q582 -22 572 -9L570 405Q563 433 556 449T529 485Q498 519 445 538T334 558Q251 558 179 518T96 401Q95 396 95 193V-7Q88 -21 75 -21Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E4-MJMATHI-42\" d=\"M231 637Q204 637 199 638T194 649Q194 676 205 682Q206 683